# Keys to build for permute_test.frag. `key -` is the base module (always required); `key A B` turns those options on.
# Every line costs one slangc run at mint time and, unless it produces the same SPIR-V as another key, one module in
# the binary.
key -
key INVERT
key HALF
key INVERT HALF
key TINT
key DEBUG
# TINT is not applied together with DEBUG, so this key builds the very same module as `key DEBUG` and shares it.
key DEBUG TINT
